# Optional image pins for the unified Quorum E2E stack.
#
# Defaults:
# - GATEWAY_TAG resolves from the local quorum checkout short SHA when available,
#   otherwise falls back to latest
# - DASHBOARD_TAG resolves from the local quorum-dash checkout short SHA when
#   available, otherwise falls back to latest
# - GRAPHITI_TAG resolves from ../graphiti/quorum-graphiti when available,
#   otherwise falls back to the known-good production pin in scripts/run.sh.

# GATEWAY_TAG=sha-ea2f792
# DASHBOARD_TAG=sha-<dashboard-commit>
# GRAPHITI_TAG=sha-d99abda38b1181d1f56198f1565510de9564f79b
